(skewed-aero)
*title Skewed aerodynamic interpolation
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*trajectory 1 glider start on 1
  *initial geodetic long=0 lat=0 psi=90 time=0 alt=50000 vel=3000 gama=-5 wt=1000
  *file skewed.dat time alt mach alphat ca
  *segment 1 glide
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *aero ca=(skew-ca)
    *fly alphat=5
    *fly phi=0
    *fly bankgd=0
    *when time=20 stop
*end
